  "contentHtml": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span data-ke-size=\"size16\">첫 차시에 배운 과학적 탐구 과정 절차를 적용해서 종이헬리콥터만들기 탐구활동을 해보려고 합니다.</span><br><span data-ke-size=\"size16\">먼저 에이크만 사례를 설명해보는 복습을 한 뒤,&#160;헬리콥터 만들기 차례차례 해보는 활동인데 아직 안해본 수업이라..</span><br><span data-ke-size=\"size16\">필요하신 분은 사용하시고 후기도 알려주시면 더욱 감사합니다!</span><br><span data-ke-size=\"size16\">(헬리콥터 만든건 교실가서 장난칠까봐 과학실에서 다 걷고 퇴실시키려 합니다.)</span><br>&#160;<br><span data-ke-size=\"size16\">캔바 (사본 만들어서 쓰세요.)</span><br><a href=\"https://www.canva.com/design/DAGhxoOR6dA/Vr9Yg3TfH9A66ojCbn5tOQ/edit?utm_content=DAGhxoOR6dA&amp;utm_campaign=designshare&amp;utm_medium=link2&amp;utm_source=sharebutton\" target=\"_top\" class=\"ke-link\"><span data-ke-size=\"size16\">https://www.canva.com/design/DAGhxoOR6dA/Vr9Yg3TfH9A66ojCbn5tOQ/edit?utm_content=DAGhxoOR6dA&amp;utm_campaign=designshare&amp;utm_medium=link2&amp;utm_source=sharebutton</span></a></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&#160;<br><span data-ke-size=\"size16\">학습지</span></p><div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/90a80a87bae6bb950807af13fb77eda2c43c207c?download\" data-file-name=\"과학적 탐구방법 적용-종이헬리콥터(공유용).hwp\" data-file-size=\"355840\" data-mimetype=\"application/haansofthwp\" data-ke-align=\"alignLeft\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DfMHw%26dataid%3D20%26fileid%3D1%26regdt%3D20250315150711&url=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafeattach%2F1TaBA%2F90a80a87bae6bb950807af13fb77eda2c43c207c')\"><div class=\"image\"></div><div class=\"desc\"><div class=\"filename\"><span class=\"name\">과학적 탐구방법 적용-종이헬리콥터(공유용)</span><span class=\"type\">.hwp</span></div><div class=\"size\">347.50KB</div></div></a></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&#160;<br>+ 그래프 그리는 부분 추가<br><a href=\"https://www.canva.com/design/DAGh5NjKm4g/GmnrMiGDZ0dP8DkvjpEANw/edit?utm_content=DAGh5NjKm4g&amp;utm_campaign=designshare&amp;utm_medium=link2&amp;utm_source=sharebutton\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://www.canva.com/design/DAGh5NjKm4g/GmnrMiGDZ0dP8DkvjpEANw/edit?utm_content=DAGh5NjKm4g&amp;utm_campaign=designshare&amp;utm_medium=link2&amp;utm_source=sharebutton</a></p><div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/647974f3d364bf7a951b6f79ae452c02f45f1916?download\" data-file-name=\"종이헬리콥터 학습지-그래프 추가(공유용).hwp\" data-file-size=\"349696\" data-mimetype=\"application/haansofthwp\" data-ke-align=\"alignLeft\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DfMHw%26dataid%3D20%26fileid%3D2%26regdt%3D20250315150711&url=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafeattach%2F1TaBA%2F647974f3d364bf7a951b6f79ae452c02f45f1916')\"><div class=\"image\"></div><div class=\"desc\"><div class=\"filename\"><span class=\"name\">종이헬리콥터 학습지-그래프 추가(공유용)</span><span class=\"type\">.hwp</span></div><div class=\"size\">341.50KB</div></div></a></div><div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/81ecd6fe926c1252e391238760e80f01ea351163?download\" data-file-name=\"종이 헬리콥터 만드는 방법.hwpx\" data-file-size=\"8726855\" data-mimetype=\"application/haansofthwpx\" data-ke-align=\"alignLeft\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DfMHw%26dataid%3D20%26fileid%3D3%26regdt%3D20250315150711&url=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafeattach%2F1TaBA%2F81ecd6fe926c1252e391238760e80f01ea351163')\"><div class=\"image\"></div><div class=\"desc\"><div class=\"filename\"><span class=\"name\">종이 헬리콥터 만드는 방법</span><span class=\"type\">.hwpx</span></div><div class=\"size\">8.32MB</div></div></a></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&#160;<br>&#160;<br>+ 수업후기&#160;<br>계산기와 자를 추가로 주었습니다. (평균계산, 날개 길이 측정)<br>&#160;<br>영상만 보고 만들기는 좀 어려워해서 순회지도하면서 추가로 알려주고,<br>총 4개 길이로 날린다음 데이터로 그래프 그리는 것 까지 했습니다.<br>역할나눠서 알아서 잘 재밌게 합니다.<br></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/379a9dce7d34aa108ad067323d030dff7c5dc363\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/379a9dce7d34aa108ad067323d030dff7c5dc363\" data-origin-width=\"376\" data-origin-height=\"340\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/b4751a604876f53b2676f9da04b15fcf3434fc5f\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/b4751a604876f53b2676f9da04b15fcf3434fc5f\" data-origin-width=\"466\" data-origin-height=\"392\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><br>그래프는 따로 알려주지 못했는데 제법 잘 그려냅니다.</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/b43070eee81b980efa0a1a5f507cc6d6f3bea1aa\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/b43070eee81b980efa0a1a5f507cc6d6f3bea1aa\" data-origin-width=\"3987\" data-origin-height=\"1396\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/bfd44955f564c95f165c9abe77f5c415c0854c97\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/bfd44955f564c95f165c9abe77f5c415c0854c97\" data-origin-width=\"3914\" data-origin-height=\"1422\"></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">어려워하는 조에게 가로축과 세로축, 눈금 알려줬습니다.<br>여기까지 하니 수업이 끝나서 정리는 다음시간으로... 표와 그래프는 조별학습지로 같이 하는 것도 더 좋을 것 같습니다.</p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
